-- CORE NAME IS RESERVED ---------------------------------------- main.kl  K0413

`Int` is a core name (spec §7.2). Core names are translated between skins, so each one means the same thing in every program and is never declared again.

2│     let Int = 3
           ^^^

Help: Choose another name for your declaration. The one core name a program declares is `main`, its entry point.

Learn more: kalam explain K0413
